* PVCELL VDMOS C_gd fit for IV3Q12013T4Z: drain ramp 0..800 V, gate held at -3.5 V
.model m VDMOS(Vto=2.8 Kp=21.36 lambda=0.01 Rd=0.009419 Rs=0.5m Rg=2.3 Cgs=4.766e-09 Cgdmax=9.548e-10 Cgdmin=8.1e-12 a=0.02264 Cjo=3.32e-09 Vj=3 M=0.5 Is=7.58e-16 N=3 Rb=0.01121 Tt=0)
Vg g 0 -3.5
Vd dd 0 PWL(0 0 10u 800.0)
Rd dd dn 1m
M1 dn g 0 m
.save i(Vg) v(dn)
.tran 5n 10u
.control
run
wrdata pv_fit_IV3Q12013T4Z.dat i(Vg) v(dn)
quit
.endc
.end
